  "Nodes": {
    "entry-00000": {
      "Id": "entry-00000",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"Be welcomed to my humble establishment. Here, what I may share with you about the making of wonders I shall, and if the need for a smithery bench or a refinery should strike you, please, do avail yourself of my workshop. That boon I free offer, so long as you not break the peace of my home.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00017",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00014",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00011",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00008",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00000",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00001": {
      "Id": "entry-00001",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"We are an ancient order of those who have studied the sublime firmament of our creation, and glimpsed as to the natural power that resonates within us all; what the Jedi Order may call the Force. We seek to mediate between the disputes of others, while working on ourselves and our crafts, for we know dearly that peace and war are both two sides of the same coppery coin.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00005",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00002",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00002": {
      "Id": "entry-00002",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"I do take in promising neophytes once in a while, but beware that I am not one to coddle, nor shall I babysit those seeking tutelage. Much of the learning will still depend on you, to quest out the secrets of our galaxy, to lengthen the horizons of your experience with adventures to distant stars. If you are certain, however, I shall test you, and if I do not find you wanting, teach you what I may at my own time.\"\n\n",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        },
        {
          "Text": "OOC: You may open a ticket if you wish for DM assistance in joining the Jal Shey.",
          "Style": 1,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00004",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00003",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00003": {
      "Id": "entry-00003",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"We are a nomadic order, that is true, and it is rare that any of us stay in any one spot for too long. I suspect that in a few years, I will move on from Viscara with my advisors and neophytes, and establish a new home somewhere else, for it is not our way to plant too deeply our roots. In the meantime, what aid I can offer the people of Viscara, and by extension, Veles, I shall.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00007",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00006",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00004": {
      "Id": "entry-00004",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"There is a limit as to what I can teach to those not initiated in my order of the Jal Shey, and for that I do apologize. However, if you try to make HoloNet broadcasts seeking help, or avail yourself of the assistance of others, I am sure that you can find those who may be able to lend you advice.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00010",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00009",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00005": {
      "Id": "entry-00005",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"What advice I can lend, I shall. For enhancements, what you must understand is that it's not enough to complete work on a craft, you must excel at its quality, too. The better quality it is, the more likely it is to hold onto the enhancements you tried to apply at the beginning of the craft.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00013",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00012",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00006": {
      "Id": "entry-00006",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"Certainly. More common ores like Veldite can be found throughout Viscara, while rarer ores such as Keromber may require you to go as far as Tatooine or the distant worlds of Dathomir. You should be aware that you will need resource harvesters to properly extract the requisite minerals from these outcroppings. This goes similarly for the wood you require; explore the vast galaxy, research diligently, and you will find what you need.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00016",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00015",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00007": {
      "Id": "entry-00007",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"Smithery can be a rewarding if tedious skill to learn. There are materials for it that you may gather throughout the galaxy, and thereafter piece together. Speak to the Guildmaster there if you want an idea as to what you should try to make, and as I often advise the Neophytes; pace yourself. Fulfill some of his contracts daily, and in time, you will come to master it.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00019",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00018",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    }
  },
